Description: MCP server for Aha! with the query language AQL
 mcp-server-aha-aql is an MCP server for the Aha! product management
 service. A language model reads and changes Aha! records through one
 query language, AQL, and two tools: query reads, and execute changes
 one record. The server runs on standard input and output (stdio), on
 HTTP (http), or as a command that makes one tool call (query, execute).
 The package has a systemd unit for the http mode.
